@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
 title Resumefolio - Risk review and closure
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  FontColor #17324D
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  DiamondBorderColor #94A3B8
  StartColor #17324D
  EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify risk, potential consequences and related work;
:Record likelihood, impact and priority separately;
:Plan response, owner, warning signs and review gate;
if (Has the risk materialized?) then (yes)
  :Record an actual issue linked to the risk;
  :Record evidence, effects and next action;
else (not observed)
  :Retain the risk as possible future exposure;
endif
:Investigate and carry out agreed responses;
:Review actual evidence and remaining risk;
if (Closure justified by evidence or explicit owner acceptance of residual risk?) then (yes)
  :Record closure basis, limits and owner decision;
else (not yet)
  :Keep risk open with next action and review point;
endif
stop
legend bottom
A written response or planning acceptance alone does not close a risk.
Material scope, cost or delivery changes require an owner decision.
Reopen or reassess when conditions or evidence change.
endlegend
@enduml
